Modifications made by Kalpraj Solutions (https://github.com/kalprajsolutions):
  - Cross-platform support: Windows, macOS, and Linux
    - Platform-aware Python virtualenv paths (venv/Scripts on Windows, venv/bin on POSIX)
    - Platform-aware audio playback: afplay (macOS), PowerShell Media.SoundPlayer (Windows),
      paplay / pw-play / aplay / ffplay (Linux)
    - Platform-aware Python interpreter detection (avoids the Windows Store python3 alias)
  - zod declared as an explicit dependency
  - Renamed configuration state directory to ~/.kokoro-tts (TTS_BASE_DIR override kept)
  - Python interpreter quoted during venv creation (paths with spaces)

This product uses the Kokoro TTS model (https://huggingface.co/hexgrad/Kokoro-82M)
downloaded at runtime from Hugging Face.
